{"abstract":"Brown adipose tissue (BAT) dissipates chemical energy as heat and can counteract obesity. MicroRNAs are emerging as key regulators in development and disease. Combining microRNA and mRNA microarray profiling followed by bioinformatic analyses, we identified miR-455 as a new regulator of brown adipogenesis. miR-455 exhibits a BAT-specific expression pattern and is induced by cold and the browning inducer BMP7. In vitro gain- and loss-of-function studies show that miR-455 regulates brown adipocyte differentiation and thermogenesis. Adipose-specific miR-455 transgenic mice display marked browning of subcutaneous white fat upon cold exposure. miR-455 activates AMPKα1 by targeting HIF1an, and AMPK promotes the brown adipogenic program and mitochondrial biogenesis. Concomitantly, miR-455 also targets the adipogenic suppressors Runx1t1 and Necdin, initiating adipogenic differentiation. Taken together, the data reveal a novel microRNA-regulated signaling network that controls brown adipogenesis and may be a potential therapeutic target for human metabolic disorders.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Zhang, Hongbin","Guan, Meiping","Townsend, Kristy L","Huang, Tian Lian","An, Ding","Yan, Xu","Xue, Ruidan","Schulz, Tim J","Winnay, Jonathon","Mori, Marcelo","Hirshman, Michael F","Kristiansen, Karsten","Tsang, John S","White, Andrew P","Cypess, Aaron M","Goodyear, Laurie J","Tseng, Yu-Hua"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-433555"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"microrna 000000000455 regulates brown adipogenesis via a novel hif000000000001an ampk pgc000000000001α signaling network","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-433555","identifier":[{"id":"84942819409","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC4766451","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"26303948","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-432c590b-4c1f-4947-bd3e-978f59bc4cee"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-61705EE5210D915BF57FB897B7EEF415"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Inflammation, Metabolism and Oxidation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Hongbin","key":"zhangpau","last":"Zhang","locid":"16b8503b-08d5-4781-961f-9943ba52129c","name":"Zhang, Hongbin","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Meiping","key":"guanpau","last":"Guan","name":"Guan, Meiping","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kristy L","key":"townsendpau","last":"Townsend","name":"Townsend, Kristy L","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tian Lian","key":"huangpau","last":"Huang","name":"Huang, Tian Lian","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ding","key":"anpau","last":"An","name":"An, Ding","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Xu","key":"yanpau","last":"Yan","name":"Yan, Xu","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Ruidan","key":"xuepau","last":"Xue","name":"Xue, Ruidan","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tim J","key":"schulzpau","last":"Schulz","name":"Schulz, Tim J","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jonathon","key":"winnaypau","last":"Winnay","name":"Winnay, Jonathon","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Marcelo","key":"moripau","last":"Mori","name":"Mori, Marcelo","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael F","key":"hirshmanpau","last":"Hirshman","name":"Hirshman, Michael F","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Karsten","key":"kristiansenpau","last":"Kristiansen","locid":"941041b1-1b8f-4be5-9a65-5e98f662c07e","name":"Kristiansen, Karsten","orcid":"0000-0002-6024-0917","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"John S","key":"tsangpau","last":"Tsang","name":"Tsang, John S","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Andrew P","key":"whitepau","last":"White","name":"White, Andrew P","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Aaron M","key":"cypesspau","last":"Cypess","name":"Cypess, Aaron M","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Laurie J","key":"goodyearpau","last":"Goodyear","name":"Goodyear, Laurie J","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Yu-Hua","key":"tsengpau","last":"Tseng","name":"Tseng, Yu-Hua","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26303948"],"pub":{"doi":"10.15252/embr.201540837","issn":["1469221X","14693178"],"issn_org":["1469221X"],"issue":"10","journal":"EMBO Reports","pages":"1378-1393","status":"p","title":"EMBO Reports","title_org":"E M B O Reports","volume":"16"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84942819409"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-432c590b-4c1f-4947-bd3e-978f59bc4cee"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"MicroRNA-455 regulates brown adipogenesis via a novel HIF1an-AMPK-PGC1α signaling network","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-433555","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVES: This study aimed to investigate the safety and therapeutic efficacy of herbal drug, Di Huang Yin Zi (DHYZ), in patients affected by ischemic stroke. METHODS: In this double blind, placebo-controlled study, a total of 100 patients with recent (less than 30 days) ischemic stroke were randomized to receive DHYZ or placebo for 12 weeks. Both groups also received rehabilitation therapy during the study period. As there were 13 dropouts, a total of 45 patients on DHYZ and 42 on placebo were available for analysis. The Fugl-Meyer Assessment (FMA) and Barthel index (BI) were assessed before treatment and at 4-week intervals. RESULTS: We observed that the FMA score and BI were increased, in both groups at week 4, 8 and 12 compared with the baseline. Furthermore, significantly better FMA score was observed in patients treated with DHYZ at week 8 and 12 (both P<0.05). BI was significantly higher in DHYZ group than in placebo group at weeks 12 (P<0.05). At week 12, the 95% Confidence Intervals (CI) of mean difference of FMA and BI also indicated that the differences between two groups were statistically significant. Compared to placebo, DHYZ produced significantly greater improvement in FMA grade at week 12 (44.4% versus 23.8%, χ(2)=4.09, P<0.05). CONCLUSIONS: DHYZ showed good efficacy, safety and tolerability in patients affected by ischemic stroke. We conclude that DHYZ may be a useful therapeutic option in patients with ischemic stroke.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Yu, Mei","Sun, Zhi-Jun","Li, Lian-Tao","Ge, Hong-You","Song, Chang-Qin","Wang, Ai-Jun"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-108804"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the beneficial effects of the herbal medicine di huang yin zi dhyz on patients with ischemic stroke a randomized placebo controlled clinical study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-108804","identifier":[{"id":"WOS:000360419700009","type":"wos"},{"id":"84939197573","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26275652","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-ca824ea8-02d2-4d85-a38c-0a37a151fbea"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-577709A901D221816BE8EAE827882AD2"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Center for Sensory-Motor Interaction"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Mei","key":"yupau","last":"Yu","name":"Yu, Mei","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Zhi-Jun","key":"sunpau","last":"Sun","name":"Sun, Zhi-Jun","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lian-Tao","key":"lipau","last":"Li","name":"Li, Lian-Tao","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hong-You","key":"gepau","last":"Ge","locid":"9f5a3bd1-9700-4ddd-9d54-ce0b7b52e851","name":"Ge, Hong-You","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Chang-Qin","key":"songpau","last":"Song","name":"Song, Chang-Qin","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ai-Jun","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","name":"Wang, Ai-Jun","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26275652"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ctim.2015.06.003","issn":["09652299","18736963"],"issn_org":["09652299"],"issue":"4","journal":"Complementary Therapies in Medicine","pages":"591-597","publisher":"Churchill Livingstone","status":"p","title":"Complementary Therapies in Medicine","volume":"23"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84939197573"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ca824ea8-02d2-4d85-a38c-0a37a151fbea"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"The beneficial effects of the herbal medicine Di-huang-yin-zi (DHYZ) on patients with ischemic stroke : a randomized, placebo controlled clinical study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-108804","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
